M? Do you wanna go?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Samantha</span>: Sounds good but you will have to book soon.  I'm sure it will be popular. Jenny and I are going to a street fair near City Hall in the afternoon.  There's going to be live bands and giveaways.", "id": 3, "time": "27500", "image": "engenn6le07ob04re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Jesse</span>: Nice. Maybe I can meet you two there and then we can head to dinner after?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Samantha</span>: Great idea! I've gotta  pick up my new glasses too. Jenny says they look glamorous.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jesse</span>: You hafta wear them at dinner. So you can look fabulous and enjoy the city skyline at the same time.", "id": 4, "time": "45000", "image": "engenn6le07ob04re2img01.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn6le07ob04re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le07ob04re2img02.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}